    "fields": {
      "Name": "BizApps Orders Integration",
      "Description": "Every integration bundle for this app, in one deterministic tier. All checks are mutation-class by nature (the suite exists to write to the database) and are gated at runtime by RUN_MUTATION_TESTS, so a run without that gate reports zero rather than failing. Bundles are independent: each owns its own committed catalog fixture and every check rolls its own transaction back, so ordering is presentational and a failure in one bundle cannot contaminate the next.",
      "Status": "Active"
    },
